{
  // Named markers that vMenu puts on everybody's map.
  //
  // There are two lists. Blips in "alwaysOn" are always drawn and a player cannot hide them. Blips
  // in "toggleable" are drawn only while the player has "Location Blips" ticked in the Display
  // Settings menu, so use that one for anything that is nice to have rather than essential.
  //
  // Each blip takes:
  //   name         the text shown on the map. Written exactly as you type it, never translated.
  //   sprite       which icon to use. There is a full list of sprite ids on the FiveM docs site.
  //   colour       which colour the icon is drawn in.
  //   scaleOffset  added to the normal size. 0 is normal, a negative number is smaller.
  //   shortRange   true means it only appears once you are near it, which is what most map
  //                furniture does. false means it is always visible on the big map.
  //   x, y, z      where it goes.
  //
  // Staff with the ManageBlips permission can also add and remove blips from inside the menu, which
  // rewrites this file. Comments you leave in here are not kept when that happens.
  //
  // Deleting this file is fine. It just means no blips are added.

